## Claim under pressure

SPRINT **CAP-G3** (grant matrix / unused V2 grants honesty):

| Slice | Path-A expectation |
|-------|--------------------|
| Type → grant | `main(p: &HttpCap)` injects **`oo_cap_grant_http`**, not `grant_net` |
| Type → grant | `main(fs: &FsReadCap)` injects **`oo_cap_grant_fsread`**, not `grant_fs` |
| Type → grant | `main(fs: &FsWriteCap)` injects **`oo_cap_grant_fswrite`** |
| Ambient | Pure / undeclared caps must **not** mint full privilege bag as live tokens for ops |
| HW/UI/Process… | Wire product require path **or** honest residual-only (no product claim) |
| Dual path | `oodac check` refuse + runtime wrong-token refuse remain CAP-G1/G2 path-A |

Adversarial stance: treat **any** emit path where declared type is granular but runtime token is legacy supersede (full Fs/Net) as **CRIT privilege widen** when check is skippable. Treat always-on main inject of unused families as **ambient all-grants** honesty fail.

